@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

title 建筑放置时序（命令模式）

actor 玩家 as P
participant "MapView" as MAP
participant "BagOfCommands" as BOC
participant "AddBuildingCommand" as CMD
participant "GameManager" as GM
participant "TechTree" as TT
participant "BuildingBuilder" as BB
participant "BuildingManager" as BM
participant "ResourceManager" as RM

P -> MAP : 点击地图地格
MAP -> BOC : addCommand(AddBuildingCommand(position))
BOC -> CMD : execute(model, controller)（后台线程）
CMD -> GM : addBuilding(selectedBuilding, position)
GM -> TT : isBuildingUnlocked(type)?（非初始建筑需科技）
TT --> GM : 未解锁 → 顶部报错，终止
GM -> BB : build(type, position)（装饰器组合功能）
GM -> MAP : isAreaFree(position, size)
GM -> BM : addBuilding(building)
BM -> RM : areAvailable(cost) → 扣资源
GM -> MAP : construct（地格置为占用）
note right of BB
  BasicBuilding 构造时进入 ConstructionState（施工状态）
end note
GM -> GM : notifyListener → View 刷新
@enduml
